From: VP Product Engineering <vp-product@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:30:52 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] fix(quic): gate TUIC and Hysteria2 forwarding on connection
 authentication

Enforce connection-bound credentials, deadlines, bounded pending work and session resources; correct TUIC packet size/mode and retain Hy2 critical streams. Add destination-observing auth-negative tests and optional independent official peer tests. Full CLI interoperability remains environment-blocked, not certified.
